Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 02:30:51 +0000
Subject: feat(ohos): trace the image cache fetch pipeline with a url-free id

KRMemoryCacheModule.CacheImage hands network images to the ArkTS
FetchFileByDownloadOrCache bridge and decodes the returned path with
LoadPixelmapFromLocal, but nothing logged whether the bridge callback ever
arrived, whether it carried a path, or whether the decode produced a
pixelmap. On HarmonyOS 1.13.0 11300010 a remote PNG downloads and decodes
through the host adapter yet its preview stays on the placeholder, and the
pipeline could not be told apart from the host display chain.

Log one INFO line per hop (dispatch, callback arrival with hasPath, result
with state and WxH) and an ERROR line for each terminal failure (module
released, no path / decode failure, no callback to deliver to), all keyed
by a short hash of the src so signed urls are never written to hilog.

Upstream-Status: pending
Fork-Patch: ohos-image-cache-fetch-trace
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

